     dance-single:
     times across BPM changes and stops:
     Easy:
     2:
     0.412,0.356,0.250,0.100,0.000:
// measure 0: taps on beats 0-3, with the 0.75 s stop on beat 2 delaying beat 3
1000
0100
0010
0001
,  // measure 1: taps on beats 4, 5 1/3 (row 4 of 12, on the 0.5 s stop) and 6
1000
0000
0000
0000
0100
0000
0010
0000
